-- MINT
-- Mint is NOT a stored mutation. Probed 2026-09-08: zero tag hits across 68
-- owned entries and 15 live Floorspace models, while MutatorModule carries
-- both IsMint() and MINT_CONDITION -- the game DERIVES it from Condition and
-- never writes it into a Mutators array. That is why the tag group stays out
-- of the mutation dropdowns (it could never match) and why "Mint" is instead
-- offered as a synthetic entry that every mutation matcher special-cases
-- through this one function.
--
-- The threshold is read from the game rather than hardcoded, so a balance
-- change follows automatically. If the constant ever disappears, Mint filters
-- refuse loudly instead of silently matching everything or nothing.
local function IsMintCondition(condition)
	local threshold = MutatorModule.MINT_CONDITION
	if type(threshold) ~= "number" then
		warn("[Mint] MutatorModule.MINT_CONDITION is missing -- Mint filters cannot match")
		return false
	end
	return type(condition) == "number" and condition >= threshold
end

