		-- Item Rules first, same order as Grade: a rule is the user saying so
		-- in as many words. There is no "force wash" half (see
		-- RULES.LANES.wash), only this block -- keeping a gavel dirty on
		-- purpose was the whole reason this lane exists.
		if RULES.LaneArmed("wash") then
